World --> Spaceport
World --> Facility
World --> BaseKind

' Zeit und Reisen
Journey "*" --> "1" Hex : from
Journey "*" --> "1" Hex : to
SystemJourney "*" --> "1" World : from
SystemJourney "*" --> "1" World : to

' Charaktererschaffung und Lebenslauf
Career "*" --> "0..1" World : homeworld
Career "*" --> "*" World : worlds {ordered}
Character "*" --> "0..1" World : homeworld

' Laufbahnen (Referenzdaten)

' Subsektor und Welten
Campaign "1" *-- "*" Hex : hexes
World "1" *-- "1" Uwp : uwp
Hex --> WorldStep
WorldRoll "*" --> "1" Hex : for
WorldRoll ..> Hex : on roll
World "*" --> "*" TradeCode : /trade
World "*" --> "0..1" Temperature : temperature
